{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27131","headline":"寺居寄杨侍御 · 周贺","name":"寺居寄杨侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨过北林空晚凉，院闲人去掩斜阳。\n十年多病度落叶，万里乱愁生夜牀。\n终欲返耕甘性拙，久惭他事与身忙。\n还知谢客名先重，肯爲诗篇问楚狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}